      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Either let us keep it as a free-for-limited-time Halloween item for everyone to keep who played VRChat during this time, or make it purchasable in the shop like any other item, or do what Discord does and let regular users keep it for free during the limited time while giving the option to keep it permanently by getting or having VRC+ (discord does that with nitro to profile decorations) but not requiring VRC+ to use it after obtained.",
